WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.969
Europe means peace.

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:09.760
It is no coincidence that the longest period
of peace in written history in Europe started

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.750
with the formation of the European Communities.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:16.630
70 years of lasting peace in Europe.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:25.500
In a world with 40 active armed conflicts,
which claim the lives of 200,000 people year after year

